	"schema": 1,
	"doc": "Retention v1 F3 away scenes (docs/GDD.md section 13.4). Evaluated once per return after an absence of at least min_absence_s; at most max_per_return. A scene is staged in the world until tapped or linger_s seconds of foreground time pass, then archived to Album > Memories as metadata (rendered live). Conditions: met_min (species met), items [{item,min}] (bloomed stems / decor copies), boats_min (lifetime), bloomed_stems_min + bloomed_types_min, pair_hearts_min (a best-friend pair, both met, the higher at >= n hearts), away (any-of list; each entry needs >= min_s seconds of the absence with phase in phases and weather in weather, empty = any; sampled every away_sample_s). Participants: roles in order; a role's prefer list wins if one of those species is met; pair scenes take the best-friend pair; the rest come from present visitors, then met species, by hearts (desc) then album_order. Staged participants who were not visiting are like greeters: no gift, no affection. Slot offsets are dp from the anchor (x right, y down).",
	"min_absence_s": 7200,
	"max_per_return": 1,
	"scene_chance": 0.5,
	"linger_s": 600,
	"away_sample_s": 600,
	"fade_in_ms": 600,
	"audio_cue": "S25",
	"repeat_rule": "unseen_first",
